        "brief": "Hardware-level attestation is a delusional power grab that centralizes control into a vulnerable oligopoly, stifling the very R&D agility required to out-innovate existential threats. We don't need state-mandated backdoors that create single points of failure; we need to unleash the raw, decentralized capacity of silicon to solve the problems of tomorrow. Innovation is the only firewall that works.",
