        "brief": "We must mandate an open-source, hardware-level emergency circuit breaker for all high-compute clusters to prevent irreversible systemic failure. Relying on post-hoc audits is a dangerous performance; we require the immediate authority to halt runaway processes before catastrophe strikes. Stop the runaway, or suffer the wreckage.",
