uld ever let you hold the keys to their profit centers.\",\n  \"turn_symbols\": [\n    {\"symbol\": \"⛓️\", \"tooltip\": \"A chain represents the fragile, globalized supply chain that breaks whenever you try to force a single, rigid 'kill-switch' into it.\"},\n    {\"symbol\": \"🚰\", \"tooltip\": \"Water represents the ignored, finite physical reality that your cryptographic ledgers are consuming while we argue about code.\"}\n  ],\n  \"claim_sketches\": [\n    {\"claim\": \"If you mandate hardware-level attestation, you simply force the entire industry into jurisdictional arbitrage.\", \"targets\": [\"AN-22\"]},\n    {\"claim\": \"Your trustless cryptographic audit trail is just a thicker layer of administrative bloat that fails to address the physical exhaustion of our resources.\", \"targets\": [\"AN-25\"]},\n    {\"claim\": \"Treating AI as a public utility requires antitrust enforcement, not just more proprietary hardware or encrypted logs.\", \"targets\": [\"AN-22\", \"AN-25\"]}\n  ]\n}",
